sequenceDiagram
    participant Remote as Áudio remoto / chamada
    participant Local as Microfone selecionado
    participant Agent as Windows Audio Agent
    participant STT as Transcription Service no WSL/Docker
    participant UI as Web Console
    participant Core as Session Core (R2)

    Remote->>Agent: loopback do endpoint selecionado
    Local->>Agent: entrada do endpoint selecionado
    Agent->>Agent: resolve perfil e atribui channelId
    Agent->>Agent: converte cada canal para PCM mono 16 kHz
    par canal remote_audio
      Agent->>STT: /ws/audio/{session}/remote_audio + metadados
    and canal local_microphone
      Agent->>STT: /ws/audio/{session}/local_microphone + metadados
    end
    STT->>STT: janela sobreposta + VAD + inferência independente
    STT-->>UI: transcript.partial.v2 por channelId
    STT-. R2 .->>Core: SessionEvent com origem preservada
    Core-. R2 .->>UI: contexto consolidado e sugestões
